---
/** Hero.astro — 首页英雄区
 *  大标题 | 副标题 | CTA 按钮 | 简洁入场动画
 */
---

<section class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center px-6 pt-20">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl animate-hero">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text leading-tight">
      Build Something
      <span class="text-accent">Interesting.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
      分享每一次创造，记录每一次成长。
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/blog"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-accent text-white font-medium text-sm transition-all
               hover:bg-blue-400 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/25 active:scale-95"
      >
        查看博客
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-muted/30 text-muted font-medium text-sm transition-all
               hover:border-text hover:text-text hover:shadow-sm active:scale-95"
      >
        关于我
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  /** 简单入场动画 */
  @keyframes heroFadeUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(24px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .animate-hero {
    animation: heroFadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }
</style>
